      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is sadly still an issue, the devs are ignoring the bluescreen reports and doing nothing about them. I'm personally never playing VRC again until they have definitively fixed these issues, here's the Canny I reported: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/vrc-causing-computer-to-blue-screen-for-no-reason",
